    "path": "00 Evidence/Transcripts/T2 correction ledger.md",
    "text": "# T2 — authoritative user correction for this draft\n\nThe latest user correction overrides both the original T1 ending and the intervening tentative speaker swap. It is supplied text, not independent video verification.\n\n| Event | Correct speaker | Treatment |\n|---|---|---|\n| Boot up already | Other Character | Exclude from Capri speech habits |\n| Scream | Capri | T2-E01; no acoustic measurements |\n| Returned to get Capri | Other Character | Context only |\n| Cool | Capri | T2-E02 |\n| Recognition of Blue | Capri | T2-E03; subsequent ellipsis stays unresolved |\n| Repairs and arm/leg joke | Capri | T2-E04; latest correction confirms original attribution |\n| Criticism of appearance | Other Character | Context for T2-E05 |\n| My finest work | Capri | T2-E05 |\n| Existential question | Other Character | Context for T2-E06 |\n| Beats me | Capri | T2-E06 |\n| Let us have fun | Other Character | Context for T2-E07 |\n| Look up / can we make it | Capri | T2-E07 |\n| Farewell to Roman | Other Character | Context only |\n\nThe parenthetical impatient/slightly demanding label sits near several corrected events. Its exact target is unclear; do not assign it automatically. No missing words in the ellipsis have been reconstructed.\n"
